    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "music doesnt help. it just makes the house feel even emptier. i feel like i'm just going through the motions. i wake up, i eat, i stare at the walls, then i sleep just to make the time go faster. it feels like life is just this repetitive loop of losing things you love. what's even the point of keeping it all going if it just ends in this?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
